of a familiar pattern -- suck up x2 -- but
{cadysti} does not mean "become active (stop
resting)" but rather "stop and rest" from a
conjunctive predicate.  So much for ease
interpretation of unfamiliar lujvo (though the
context would give one pause for the first
interpretation -- unless he meant getting busy at
some other work, from which Lojban was a rest). 

